  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"The Moon Fairy\" – A graceful duchess named Martina, known for her ethereal beauty and referred to as the \"Moon Fairy,\" learns of the betrayal by her fiancé, the prince. In a moment of heartbreak, she suddenly disappears from the castle.\n\n\"After being mocked like this, I don’t care anymore!\" she declares, throwing away her long hair and restrictive dress. She descends into the craftsmen’s district of the capital city. To escape the heat of the situation, she decides to disguise herself as a young adventurer.\n\nMartina, now disguised as a boy, partners with the adventurer Leon, a person who piques her interest. Together, they take on various quests. However, her skills, honed by her mother and the royal family’s training, are no joke. Caught up in the thrill of battle, she unwittingly reveals her exceptional swordsmanship and top-tier magical abilities.\n\nAs if that wasn’t enough, an unexpected quest arrives—one that could blow her cover!\n\nA runaway young lady, living life freely and embracing her escape, this is a love fantasy filled with adventures and secrets!"
  },
